# Gemini AI Chatbot

## Overview
This project is an AI chatbot built using Python, Flask, and the Google Gemini API. Users can ask questions through a web interface and receive AI-generated responses.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Flask
- Google Gemini API
- HTML and CSS

## Project Files
- `app.py` — Contains the Flask application and Gemini API integration.
- `requirements.txt` — Lists the Python dependencies required to run the project.

## Prerequisites
- Python installed
- Google Gemini API key

## Installation and Setup

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone <repository-url>
